title: Unitary Campaigning
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: not rubicon or unity_campaign_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; unity_campaign_timer = 2 if rubicon
card-image: img/jxsi/campaign.jpeg
face-image: img/jxsi/campaign.jpeg
tags: jxsi_party jxcat_party
role: card-party

= Unitary Campaigning!

Whether or not we are in an electoral campaign, it's always a good idea for the [? if jxsi_formed and not jxsi_dissolved: jxsi?][? if jxcat_formed and not jxcat_dissolved: jxcat?] coalition to try its best to have its message reach as much people as possible. Who should we focus our campaign efforts on?

- @workers: The industrial working class, including factory workers, construction workers, and service workers.
- @redbelt: The working class in the metropolitan area of Barcelona, the traditional stronghold of the PSC.
- @middle: The middle working class of professionals, public employees, and highly qualified workers.
- @business: Small business owners and the self-employed.
- @rural: Rural workers and small farmers from rural Catalonia.
- @retirees: The retired and elderly population.
- @unemployed: The unemployed.
- @local_election_erc: Focus on the upcoming local elections instead.
- @congreso_election: Focus the coalition's resources on the upcoming Congreso election.
- @root: We either don't want to or cannot campaign right now.
- @easy_discard

@workers
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
    var effectiveness = Math.max(0, 1-(Q.player_in_jxsi ? (Q.jxsi_dissent || 0) : (Q.jxcat_dissent || 0))/100);
    var governing = Q.cat_coalition.includes(Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat");
    var credibility = Q.burdens_broken && governing ? 0.35 : 1;
    var weights = {barcelona:0.45, girona:1.2, lleida:1.2, tarragona:0.75};
    for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
        var amount = weights[c]*effectiveness*credibility;
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"parlament", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"psc", amount:amount*0.5, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:[c], demographics:["ind"]});
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"parlament", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"federal_left", amount:amount*0.3, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:[c], demographics:["ind"]});
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"parlament", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"abstain", amount:amount*0.2, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:[c], demographics:["ind"]});
    }
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"congreso", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"psoe", amount:0.4*effectiveness*credibility, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:["catalunya"]});
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"congreso", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"federal_left", amount:0.25*effectiveness*credibility, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:["catalunya"]});
    Q.party_resources -= 1;
!}

The coalition has broadened its campaign among industrial and service workers across Catalonia. [? if burdens_broken: Our record in government makes the social promises behind the campaign much harder to believe, though. ?]

@redbelt
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
view-if: gabriel_rufian_advisor = 1 or erc_break_red_belt = 1 or cup_break_red_belt = 1
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
    var effectiveness = Math.max(0, 1-(Q.player_in_jxsi ? (Q.jxsi_dissent || 0) : (Q.jxcat_dissent || 0))/100);
    var governing = Q.cat_coalition.includes(Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat");
    var credibility = Q.burdens_broken && governing ? 0.35 : 1;
    for (var d of ["ind", "unemployed"]) {
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"parlament", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"psc", amount:0.8*effectiveness*credibility, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:["barcelona"], demographics:[d]});
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"parlament", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"federal_left", amount:0.3*effectiveness*credibility, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:["barcelona"], demographics:[d]});
    }
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"congreso", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"psoe", amount:0.6*effectiveness*credibility, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:["catalunya"]});
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"barcelona", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"psc", amount:0.65*effectiveness*credibility, maxDonorFraction:0.5});
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"barcelona", to: (Q.player_in_jxsi ? "jxsi" : "jxcat"), from:"federal_left", amount:0.25*effectiveness*credibility, maxDonorFraction:0.5});
    Q.erc_redbelt_mod += 0.65*effectiveness*credibility;
    Q.party_resources -= 1;
!}

We have concentrated the coalition's campaigning in Barcelona's red belt, where breaking the PSC's long dominance remains hard, but no longer a pipe dream.

