    Q.party_resources -= 1;
!}

The coalition has concentrated its resources on the Congreso race, arguing that a single united Catalan delegation can exert more pressure than its component parties could separately. [? if broken_roadmap: After the failure of our proimised roadmap to independence, however, it is undeniable that we face considerable skepticism. ?]
